  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Number of males = 14\r\nand females $=6$\r\nTotal =14+6=20\r\nMales above $40 \\mathrm{yr}=8$ \r\nand females above $40 \\mathrm{y}=3$\r\nNow, P (selected person is female and above 40 yn) $=\\frac{3}{6}=\\frac{1}{2}$",
